Algorithm 1: General flow of agent-environment interaction.
$S_0 \sim d_0$;
for $t = 0$ to $\infty$ do
    $A_t \sim \pi(S_t, \cdot)$;
    $S_{t+1} \sim p(S_t, A_t, \cdot)$;
    $R_t \sim d_R(S_t, A_t, S_{t+1})$;

